src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/9d4a9876cc5c733e.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Hey… yeah. That’s another Monday on the books before the weather turns colder. ...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/9b0f8fa864b58847.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Hey… yeah. That’s another Monday on the books before the weather turns colder. ...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/843433a7033d1551.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Hey… yeah. That’s another Monday on the books before the weather turns colder. ...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/5ec9d2030050854f.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;img alt=&quot;Hey… yeah. That’s another Monday on the books before the weather turns colder. ...&quot; loading=&quot;lazy&quot; src=&quot;https://rvabikefeed.github.io/images/8fde5bedcab52232.jpg&quot;/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Hey… yeah. That’s another Monday on the books before the weather turns colder. &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
78 of us made our way down alleys and side streets through the Fan, Randolph and VCU. There were a few missteps, but that’s what happens when you “play jazz” with the routes. &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
We had a cool interaction with a running group. And the encouragement to “do your thing!!” goes both ways! &lt;br/&gt;
😄🏃‍♀️🚲&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
We topped off the night with a pass by the Science Museum… something we haven’t done in a long time! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
But that was it. Another ride safely completed. Thanx everyone for coming out, and thanx to the BMB crew for making things go as well as it did! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Have a great week. Stay safe and we’ll see you Monday. 😄😺🚲❤️👍🏾 #bikemondaybros</content></entry>
